    "Plain conversation. Use for questions, explanations, syntax help. Does not read or modify your scripts.": "纯对话。用于提问、解释和语法帮助。不会读取或修改你的脚本。",
    "For larger models with tool support. The AI can read, create, and edit scripts, look up datapoints, and browse the object tree — useful for \"create a script that...\", \"which scripts use this state?\" or \"analyze my light script\".": "适用于支持工具调用的较大模型。AI 可以读取、创建和编辑脚本，查询数据点并浏览对象树——适用于\"创建一个脚本，执行...\"、\"哪些脚本使用了此状态?\"或\"分析我的灯光脚本\"等场景。",
    "For smaller models without tool support. Two-step script generator (plan then code) — useful for \"create a script that...\" or \"write a Blockly rule for...\". Output goes into the editor for smart-apply.": "适用于不支持工具调用的较小模型。两步脚本生成器（先计划再生成代码）——适用于\"创建一个脚本，执行...\"或\"为...编写 Blockly 规则\"。输出进入编辑器以供 smart-apply 使用。",
    "Plain conversation. Best for: general questions, syntax help, concept explanations.": "纯对话。最适合：一般问题、语法帮助、概念解释。",
    "For larger models with tool support. Best for: creating, editing, or analyzing scripts; finding datapoint usages; inspecting the object tree.": "适用于支持工具调用的较大模型。最适合：创建、编辑或分析脚本；查找数据点用法；检查对象树。",
    "For smaller models without tool support. Best for: creating new JavaScript/TypeScript or Blockly scripts from a description.": "适用于不支持工具调用的较小模型。最适合：根据描述创建新的 JavaScript/TypeScript 或 Blockly 脚本。",
